=== env ===
Usage: hops env [OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...

  Python environment commands (list, clone, install).

Options:
  --json                  Output as JSON (machine-readable; for LLMs and
                          scripts).
  --verify / --no-verify  Verify the Hopsworks TLS certificate; --no-verify
                          skips verification for self-signed / IP-SAN-
                          mismatched certs.
  -h, --help              Show this message and exit.

Commands:
  clone    Clone SOURCE into a new environment NEW_NAME.
  install  Install a requirements.txt into ENV_NAME.
  list     List Python environments in the current project.
